	["cs.melody4.3"] = "Seen from above, Melody keeps playing as the NecroDancer crawls toward her.",
	["cs.melody4.4"] = "Close up of the NecroDancer's snarling face, his eyes glowing red.",
	["cs.melody4.5"] = "Close up: Melody strums the lute calmly and never stops.",
	["cs.melody4.6"] = "The NecroDancer rears up and screams in rage in a burst of purple light.",
	["cs.melody5.1"] = "The NecroDancer staggers back toward an open stone coffin.",
	["cs.melody5.2"] = "A flash of purple light: a grey-haired woman in a purple dress drives a dagger into him from behind while Melody looks on.",
	["cs.melody5.3"] = "His red cloak crumples to the ground at the woman's feet.",
	["cs.melody5.4"] = "In the dim crypt, Melody turns to the grey-haired woman, who still holds the dagger.",
	["cs.nocturna1.1"] = "A crypt full of strange machines. Nocturna, a vampire with pale blue skin, red hair and bat wings, holds up a torch beside a giant skull.",
	["cs.nocturna1.2"] = "A skeleton lies slumped against pipes and gauges as a spark runs along a cable.",
	["cs.nocturna1.3"] = "Seen from below, Nocturna stands tall with the torch, wings spread.",
	["cs.nocturna1.4"] = "She flies down a dark staircase, torch first.",
	["cs.nocturna2.1"] = "Nocturna holds up a torch in a room of machines and glowing dials, reaching toward the wall.",
	["cs.nocturna2.2"] = "She walks down a long metal corridor lined with cables and lights.",
	["cs.nocturna2.3"] = "Close up: her blue hand touches thick cables crackling with yellow electricity.",
	["cs.nocturna2.4"] = "Seen from above, she follows the glowing cables across the floor.",
	["cs.nocturna2.5"] = "She flies on, wings spread, down a tunnel lit by fire.",
	["cs.nocturna3.1"] = "A skeleton in a helmet, wired into the machines, sits slumped among yellow sparks.",
	["cs.nocturna3.2"] = "Close up: Nocturna studies it, unimpressed.",
	["cs.nocturna3.3"] = "She crouches beside the skeleton and pulls at the cables in its back.",
	["cs.nocturna3.4"] = "She holds the bundle of cables in both hands, then clenches her fists.",
	["cs.nocturna3.5"] = "She heads off alone down a long corridor; another wired skeleton hangs from the wall.",
	["cs.nocturna4.1"] = "A flashback: a young woman with brown skin and curly brown hair screams and reaches out as a blue vampire with red eyes bites her neck, a church behind them under a purple sky.",
	["cs.nocturna4.2"] = "Her skin turns pale blue and her hair red as fire burns behind her.",
	["cs.nocturna4.3"] = "In a forest of white birch trees, the winged Nocturna crouches over a fallen animal while red eyes watch from the dark.",
	["cs.nocturna4.4"] = "A tall vampire with long flowing red hair crawls out of the darkness toward her.",
	["cs.nocturna4.5"] = "Close up: Nocturna looks at her bloodied hands, then clenches them into fists.",
	["cs.nocturna5.1"] = "A laboratory of machines. A huge purple mechanical body lies on a table, its chest glowing as sparks fly.",
	["cs.nocturna5.2"] = "Nocturna, a sword in her hand, steps toward it.",
	["cs.nocturna5.3"] = "A woman in a purple coat and brass goggles, with wild blond hair and blue lips, turns from her work: the Conductor.",
	["cs.nocturna5.4"] = "Nocturna points her sword at her through the steam.",
	["cs.nocturna5.5"] = "The Conductor crosses her arms, unimpressed.",
	["cs.nocturna5.6"] = "She looks down at Nocturna with a sly smile.",
	["cs.nocturna5.7"] = "She steps up to a machine and lifts out a golden lute.",
	["cs.nocturna5.8"] = "The lute blazes with yellow light in her hands.",
	["cs.nocturna5.9"] = "Nocturna raises her sword.",
	["cs.nocturna5.10"] = "Nocturna leaps at her as lightning bursts from the lute.",
	["cs.nocturna6.1"] = "Nocturna stands over the Conductor's wrecked machine, smoke rising, sword in hand.",
	["cs.nocturna6.2"] = "She looks at her open hand.",
	["cs.nocturna6.3"] = "Red energy swirls around her. Her eyes glow red and she grins, fangs bared.",
	["cs.nocturna6.4"] = "She seizes a golden device crackling with lightning, raises it with a scream and smashes it into a mirror.",
	["cs.nocturna6.5"] = "She grabs the golden lute and lifts it over her head, eyes blazing.",
	["cs.nocturna6.6"] = "Her eyes return to normal. She hesitates.",
	["cs.nocturna6.7"] = "In the cracked mirror she sees her human self: a woman with brown skin, curly brown hair and round glasses.",
	["cs.nocturna6.8"] = "She lowers the lute and holds it calmly, her eyes now gold.",
	["cs.nocturna6.9"] = "Light falls down a shaft from above. Her silhouette rises into it and is gone.",
	["cs.introDlc.1"] = "Night in a graveyard under a full moon and a purple sky. A rat with glowing pink eyes creeps along a branch.",
	["cs.introDlc.2"] = "Leaves blow over the graves.",
	["cs.introDlc.3"] = "A dark clawed hand rises from the earth in front of a tomb, while a shape with red eyes perches above it.",
	["cs.introDlc.4"] = "A hooded figure with glowing red eyes looms in the dark.",
	["cs.introDlc.5"] = "Close up: red vampire eyes and a sly smile.",
	["cs.introDlc.6"] = "A winged silhouette lands beside an old stone tomb.",
	["cs.introDlc.7"] = "Nocturna stands under the full moon, hands on her hips, bat wings spread.",
	["cs.introDlc.8"] = "She stamps down and the stone slab of the tomb shatters.",
	["cs.introDlc.9"] = "She peers into the broken tomb, where a glowing pink passage leads down.",
	["cs.introDlc.10"] = "She dives in, and dead hands claw out of the earth behind her.",
	["cs.aria0.1"] = "In the crypt, Melody plays the golden lute. Behind her stands her mother Aria: grey hair, a purple dress, brown leather armour, a dagger in her hand.",
	["cs.aria0.2"] = "Close up: Melody glares at her, angry.",
	["cs.aria0.3"] = "Aria looks down, ashamed, lit by torchlight.",
	["cs.aria0.4"] = "Melody's anger softens into sadness; she keeps playing.",
	["cs.aria0.5"] = "Aria holds out her open hand to her daughter.",
	["cs.aria1.1"] = "Aria plays the golden lute before an archway of stone and skulls.",
	["cs.aria1.2"] = "In a dark, overgrown shrine she raises the lute beside a stone pedestal where a pink flame burns.",
	["cs.aria1.3"] = "The lute comes alive in her hands: its neck curls like a golden dragon and it grows claws, as the pink flame flares.",
	["cs.aria2.1"] = "A tavern. A young bard with a red beard and a blue shirt plays a lute on a small stage, while the drinkers ignore him.",
	["cs.aria2.2"] = "Later, in a dark forest, the same bard, with a pack and a walking stick, shields his eyes from a golden lute glowing on a stone.",
	["cs.aria3.1"] = "The bard, Octavian, plays the golden lute for an army of monsters: a huge red minotaur with golden horns, a green slime full of bones, skeletons waving swords.",
	["cs.aria3.2"] = "Long before, Aria walks through the empty crypt with a shovel and a torch.",
	["cs.aria3.3"] = "Close up: Octavian, now blue-skinned and undead, with a long white beard and a red cloak, plays the lute with weary, hollow eyes.",
	["cs.aria3.4"] = "The lute slips from his hands and fades into darkness.",
	["cs.aria4.1"] = "Aria, a shovel at her side, plays the golden lute over an open stone coffin where the NecroDancer lies.",
	["cs.aria4.2"] = "Blue hands grip the edge of the coffin as he wakes.",
	["cs.aria4.3"] = "The NecroDancer stands and reaches toward the lute while Aria keeps playing.",
	["cs.aria4.4"] = "In a burst of purple light, Aria holds the lute out and his blue hands close on it.",
	["cs.aria4.5"] = "He snatches the lute and knocks Aria aside, his eyes glowing red.",
	["cs.aria5.1"] = "In the overgrown shrine, Aria shields her eyes as purple lightning pours from the pedestal around the golden lute.",
	["cs.aria5.2"] = "She smashes the lute down on the pedestal and beams of purple light burst out.",
	["cs.aria5.3"] = "Purple lightning wraps around her and she sinks against the stone.",
	["cs.aria5.4"] = "At sunset on a hilltop, Cadence stands before a gravestone carved with the name Aria.",
	["cs.aria5.5"] = "Melody and Dorian join her, arm in arm, as the sun goes down.",
}
